.TH FERMI_SSO_JAR_GUI 1 "2026-10-30" "requests-fermi-sso 0.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fermi_sso_jar_gui \- Qt viewer for the Fermilab SSO cookie jar
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fermi_sso_jar_gui
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fermi_sso_jar_gui
is a Qt front end to the engine behind
.BR fermi_sso_jar (1).
The window shows the identity provider and every catalog site with the
state of its cookies on the left, the selected site's cookies on the
right, a log of what has been done below, and buttons for the same
operations the command line offers.
.PP
Network work runs on a worker thread and reports back through Qt
signals; the buttons that start network work are disabled while a job
runs. The jar file is re\-read every five seconds, so logins performed by
other processes appear on their own.
.PP
Needs PySide6 (preferred) or PyQt6:
.B pip install 'requests\-fermi_sso[gui]'
or
.BR "pip install PySide6" .
.SH BUTTONS
.TP
.B Prime site
Log in to the selected site if its cookies do not sign in, and save the
jar. A password is asked for in a dialog when the configured credential
lacks one; it is kept for this run only.
.TP
.B Prime all
Prime every site through one identity\-provider session.
.TP
.B Refresh stale
Prime only the sites whose cookies are absent, expired or expiring soon.
.TP
.B Verify site / Verify all
Cookies\-only network check.
.TP
.B Clear site
Remove the selected site's cookies from the jar, after confirmation. On
the
.B idp
row, the identity provider's cookies.
.TP
.B Purge expired
Drop every expired cookie.
.TP
.B Show values
Show cookie values in full. They are bearer credentials.
.TP
.B Add site...
A form for a new catalog entry: key, SSO entry URL, name, expected text,
cookie domains, connection, JavaScript redirect flag and notes, written to
.IR ~/.fermi_sso/sites.yaml ,
optionally verified at once. See
.BR fermi_sso_sites (5).
.TP
.B Setup...
Record the account, method, PIN file and jar path in the env file (mode
600), optionally with the password, and show the shell lines and a
scheduler recipe for a periodic refresh.
.TP
.B Reload
Re\-read the jar now.
.SH OPTIONS
The common and credential options of
.BR fermi_sso_jar (1),
with the same precedence.
.SH EXIT STATUS
The Qt application's exit status, or 2 when Qt is not installed or a
setting is invalid.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
fermi_sso_jar_gui
fermi_sso_jar_gui \-e ~/.fermi_sso.env \-a yubikey \-\-pin\-source ~/.fermi_sso.pin
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fermi_sso_jar (1),
.BR fermi_sso_jar_tui (1),
.BR fermi_sso_sites (5)
